an inheritance to them that fear your name.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"You shall add days to the days of the king; you shall lengthen his years to all generations.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"He shall endure for ever before God: which of them will seek out his mercy and truth?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"So will I sing to your name for ever and ever, that I may daily perform my vows.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_lxx/PSA/60.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_lxx/PSA/61.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_lxx/PSA/59.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}